### 新增商品（code 由 basic-data 自動產生，例如 P2026100001）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "BK-0001",
  "name": "Spring 實戰",
  "category": "BOOK",
  "price": 680,
  "stock": 10,
  "onSale": true
}

### 查單筆
GET http://localhost:8080/api/product/1

### 條件分頁查詢：關鍵字（code、sku 或 name）、分類 IN、價格區間、上架中，新的在前
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product/queryPage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "Spring",
  "categories": ["BOOK", "ELECTRONICS"],
  "minPrice": 100,
  "maxPrice": 1000,
  "onSale": true,
  "page": 1,
  "size": 20,
  "sort": [{ "field": "transTime", "direction": "desc" }]
}

### 驗證失敗：minPrice 大於 maxPrice → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minPrice": 500,
  "maxPrice": 100
}

### 修改（只改有給的欄位）
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 599
}

### 出庫 3 件；庫存不足時回 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product/1/stock?quantity=-3

### 批次查詢
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 3]

### 刪除
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/product/1
